**Critic, wave 1** — continue: 4 findings stand up to the evidence, 4 questioned ('Sterile-nu server BBN baselines are Yp=0.2449±0.004 (Aver, Olive & Skillman JCAP 07 2021 0': Evidence tc-261102_1-w1-d-15-22 is generic server help text listing tool names; it contains no Yp, D/H, N_eff values, no validity ranges (N_eff 2.044-6.044, omega_b h2, tau_n), and no Delta chi2>3.84 threshold to support the claimed baselines.; 'DW vs SF at m_s=20 keV, sin^2 2theta=1e-14: DW gives Delta N_eff=1.42e-07, Omega_s h^2=3.0': Evidence tc-261102_1-w1-d-14-51 and tc-261102_1-w1-d-14-52 show only the 20 keV rows (Delta N_eff 1.416e-07/1.416e-08, Omega 3.04e-05/4.898). The claimed 50 keV points (Omega 1.58e-04/30.6), overclose factors 40x/255x, and derived viability interpretation are not in the excerpts.; 'DW BBN emulator at high-mass SPI regime m_s=40,50 keV with sin^2 2theta=1e-12,3e-14,1e-14 ': Evidence tc-261102_1-w1-d-13-26 shows only the first of 6 rows (40 keV 1e-12 Delta N_eff 2.466e-05 Omega 0.01059) and summary counts 0 excluded/0 overclose. It does not contain the full 6-point ranges for Delta N_eff, Omega_s h2, tau, or individual Delta chi2_BBN values claimed.; 'Primary NuSTAR 11-yr stray-light paper arXiv:2405.17861 Fig.1 extracted: 95% CL sin^2 2the': Evidence tc-261102_1-w1-d-13-54 confirms extraction of 4 figures including fig01.png but the excerpt contains no caption text, no 95% CL, no 117 Ms/FPM, no |b|>3 deg selection, and no 40 keV instrumental excess note to support the detailed limit description.).

Issues: X-ray emulator uses whole-halo f_DM=1 with no FOV/J-factor cut; claimed 'not excluded' cannot be verified against NuSTAR stray-light or SPI diffuse limits without primary-paper definition of sin^2 2theta normalization and profile. SPI lifetime mismatch (tool tau 7.8e26 s vs quoted 1e20 s at 50 keV/3e-14) remains unresolved.; Server SF capped at L=0.1 with heuristic Delta N_eff=0.1xDW and no xi_e/BR/T_RH physics; Omega_s h2 4.9-30.6 at 1e-14 is unphysical and cannot test literature L>0.5 viable region (Vogel 2507.18752 m_s>10 keV sin^2<1e-14). DW normalization 10-17x dispute (server 2.55e-10 vs Abazajian 3.0e-9 at 7.1 keV) lacks verbatim Eq.37 quote.; BBN baseline provenance not cited verbatim; brief vs server values (Yp 0.245 vs 0.2449, D/H 2.53 vs 2.547e-5) and Planck N_eff prior impact on Delta N_eff<0.5-0.6 bound not quantified. Report synthesis depends on CSVs/PNGs in runs/261102_164917 without list_files verification..
